            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The exchanges of the locomotive manufacturing are derived from an assessment of the RE 460, a locomotive which is currently used for goods transportation in Switzerland and also in Germany. The life span of the locomotive Re 460 is assumed to be 40 years resulting in a life time performance of 9.6 Mio. kilometres. The materials with a weight above 200 kg are accounted for. A detailed specification of electronic components was not possible. Total weight of the locomotive is about 84t.;
UUID: e9f8c142-1372-38e8-b6fd-28e16d130f90</common:generalComment>
