        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">The modelled locomotive is a rather modern locomotive. For older locomotives, which are still in operation, aluminium and plastic share may be lower.\n\n# Included processes\nThis inventory calls processes of material production, representing the material composition of one locomotive. For manufacturing, electricity and light oil burned in industrial furnance are included. For the transportation of materials standandard distance are applied.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
